{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/99553a6924f58b7d5218becfa4dee86b.avif?t=1772657765\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unguided is a part of Steam Next Fest! Demo is live, &lt;RUN&gt;, suffer, &lt;EOL&gt;,\u00a0&lt;RUN&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We support Steam Deck with steady 60 FPS on 8 W profile, try it out and tell us what you think, we value all feedback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.poster.avif?t=1772657765\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.webm?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.mp4?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unguided is a challenging, fast-paced roguelite slasher with stamina-based combat drawing inspiration from Tron and 1980s sci-fi artwork and music. The game puts you in control of an inmate in a digital prison with only one way out - to get to the remote  server of the abandoned human cloning laboratory, upload yourself back into the blank body, and get revenge on the ones who framed you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.poster.avif?t=1772657765\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.webm?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.mp4?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unforgiving combat that requires precise timing and stamina management. Slash, shoot, and dodge your way through the PIT prison for a chance to live again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine attack and defence routines  and execute cross-weapon combos to get the most out of your 1N-M8 stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your personal codebase bit by bit, upgrade your 1N-M8 stack, and unlock permanent upgrades to change the way you fight and reach new areas of the PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the end of the ever-changing system, filled with humanity's most dangerous and twisted minds. Befriend the worst of them. Use raw Source Code to recover your  memories or help other inmates rewrite theirs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.poster.avif?t=1772657765\" width=718 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.webm?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.mp4?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome to the PIT, the most humane prison in the history of mankind. It's a one-way ticket designed with a simple goal in mind - keep the moralists at bay. You see, in 2037, we're executing criminals by the thousands, and apparently, that had upset a religion or two. But what if we could still permanently remove these elements from society, but you know... with all the &quot;thou shalt not kill&quot; part still intact? Enter the Personality Improvement Technology, once a long-buried human mind digitalization  program, and a savior to society nowadays. Problem solved - the &quot;immortal&quot; part gets sent to the PIT, and the body gets the good 'ol &quot;...have mercy on your soul&quot; treatment.&quot; - from the book &quot;How it's done: Albert Kramer's story&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2611920?t=1772657765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772657765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/2258e465dcdda03e94cda936285b61eb3198350d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772657765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/2258e465dcdda03e94cda936285b61eb3198350d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772657765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Players control an inmate, trying to escape a digital prison. From an isometric perspective, players explore environments based on other inmates' minds. Players engage in melee-style combat against digitalized humans and abstract, primitive-shaped sentinels of the system. Players use digital routines depicted as weapons (swords, spears, revolvers) to kill enemies. Enemies emit pieces of code when injured/killed, with no depiction of realistic blood."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4041400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/99553a6924f58b7d5218becfa4dee86b.avif?t=1772657765\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unguided is a part of Steam Next Fest! Demo is live, &lt;RUN&gt;, suffer, &lt;EOL&gt;,\u00a0&lt;RUN&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We support Steam Deck with steady 60 FPS on 8 W profile, try it out and tell us what you think, we value all feedback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.poster.avif?t=1772657765\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.webm?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.mp4?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unguided is a challenging, fast-paced roguelite slasher with stamina-based combat drawing inspiration from Tron and 1980s sci-fi artwork and music. The game puts you in control of an inmate in a digital prison with only one way out - to get to the remote  server of the abandoned human cloning laboratory, upload yourself back into the blank body, and get revenge on the ones who framed you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.poster.avif?t=1772657765\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.webm?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.mp4?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unforgiving combat that requires precise timing and stamina management. Slash, shoot, and dodge your way through the PIT prison for a chance to live again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine attack and defence routines  and execute cross-weapon combos to get the most out of your 1N-M8 stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your personal codebase bit by bit, upgrade your 1N-M8 stack, and unlock permanent upgrades to change the way you fight and reach new areas of the PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the end of the ever-changing system, filled with humanity's most dangerous and twisted minds. Befriend the worst of them. Use raw Source Code to recover your  memories or help other inmates rewrite theirs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.poster.avif?t=1772657765\" width=718 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.webm?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.mp4?t=1772657765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome to the PIT, the most humane prison in the history of mankind. It's a one-way ticket designed with a simple goal in mind - keep the moralists at bay. You see, in 2037, we're executing criminals by the thousands, and apparently, that had upset a religion or two. But what if we could still permanently remove these elements from society, but you know... with all the &quot;thou shalt not kill&quot; part still intact? Enter the Personality Improvement Technology, once a long-buried human mind digitalization  program, and a savior to society nowadays. Problem solved - the &quot;immortal&quot; part gets sent to the PIT, and the body gets the good 'ol &quot;...have mercy on your soul&quot; treatment.&quot; - from the book &quot;How it's done: Albert Kramer's story&quot;</p>","developers":["SIX/five Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/2a03fa7184cf4869f0279ecd21ec38e46355aa99/header.jpg?t=1772657765","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2611920/41468868/56a88a9f0ac2e4f9f934f6455971c2b9ae2f7fa2/1771361518/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772657760","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2611920/41468868/56a88a9f0ac2e4f9f934f6455971c2b9ae2f7fa2/1771361518/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772657760","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2611920/41468868/56a88a9f0ac2e4f9f934f6455971c2b9ae2f7fa2/1771361518/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772657760","id":257288943,"name":"Demo Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"