ld, and get revenge on the ones who framed you in this fast-paced challenging roguelike slasher. Demo is live! &lt;RUN&gt;, suffer, &lt;EOL&gt;, &lt;RUN&gt;","steam_appid":2611920,"support_info":{"email":"unguided@sixfivegames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}